# Line-ending contract: every text file is LF in the repository and in the
# working tree, whatever core.autocrlf is set to. The generator finds its
# regions by matching exact line strings and `bun tools/generate.mjs --check`
# compares on-disk text, so a checkout that turns these files CRLF fails with a
# missing anchor. The committed text is already LF, so this changes no content.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The PNG assets are binary and stay byte for byte.
*.png binary
